{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight for survival on a frozen planet infested with deadly creatures. This isn\u2019t about winning \u2014 it\u2019s about not losing.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tactical Turn-Based Combat:</strong> Command multiple combat robots and defend your crew against monstrous threats during tense expeditions, while your team carries out critical tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Campaign Mode:</strong> Lead your crew through a story-driven campaign of dangerous, multi-phase missions \u2014 each one handcrafted, unique, and spanning multiple nights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Handcrafted Characters:</strong> Your crew isn\u2019t made up of numbers. Each has their own backstory, personality, and moral compass \u2014 and not everyone will agree with your decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Permanent Death:</strong> Every mistake comes at a cost. Lose a soldier, a friend, or even your last hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Research &amp; Upgrades:</strong> Strengthen your station and enhance your machines to stand a chance against a brutal world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crew Management:</strong> Assign tasks carefully to avoid mental breakdowns, exhaustion, and lasting injuries. Balance survival with sacrifice.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706210?t=1749671990","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706210?t=1749671990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/754f4664d129ff9156643f01350377c0d8817539/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749671990","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/754f4664d129ff9156643f01350377c0d8817539/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749671990","categories":[{"description":"Single-playe